=== PHASE 4b - THE STATE-BLIND RATE-MATCHED RANDOM EXIT (the control the repo demands)
======================================================================================================================
   An exit rule must beat a coin flip that removes the same holding time. Control:
   C_i ~ Exponential(lambda), realised hold = min(dur_i, ceil(C_i)), lambda solved so the
   MEAN realised hold equals the deterministic cap's. Memoryless => carries zero
   information about the state. 1,000 draws. A second, differently-shaped control
   (uniform on [1, 2T]) is run beside it so the answer is not an artefact of one shape.

